From 86fe6138ebf7369bc5e2d59911951fac843ebca2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:56:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): git's stop message has one home in the stop state

nextStop sets stopMessage where it reports the stopped problem;
clearStop clears it; the store's read-back is gone. Summary literals
gain remembered: 0.

Refs #1420
